  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can channel essence to enhance your combat prowess while under the effects of your form shifting magics.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Any (transformation) Alteration sphere talent, or the Transformation feat</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can invest essence into this feat. While under the effects of any transformation other than Blank Form or while under the effects of the Transformation feat, you gain an insight bonus on attack rolls made with natural weapons equal to the number of points of essence invested in this feat. You gain 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/akashic-feats#toc65\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
